                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On October 19 Messrs. Acheson, Snyder, and Foster met with M. Petsche to discuss
                    the French proposals contained in the memorandum of August 17. For a summary of
                    this discussion, see telegram Todep 66 to London, October 19, <ref
                        target="#pg391">page 391</ref>.</p>
            </div>
